{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51018","headline":"失题 · 无名氏","name":"失题","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"东上波流西上船，桃源未必有真仙。\n干戈满目家何在，寂寞空山闻杜鹃。\n（见《江南余载》卷下。\n南唐开宝末诗也。\n）（〖1〗《江南余载》：「开宝末，长老法伦梦金陵兵火四起，有书生朗吟曰〖诗不重录〗」云云。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"无名氏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51018.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51018","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}